{{Short description|Wikipedia editing guideline}}
{{redirect-several|dab=no|Wikipedia:Simplified Manual of Style|WP:Summary (disambiguation)|WP:SS (disambiguation)}}
{{Subcat guideline|editing guideline|Summary style|WP:SS|WP:SUMMARY}}
{{nutshell|Sections of long articles should be spun off into their own articles, leaving summaries in their place. Summary sections link to the detailed article with a {{tl|Main}} template.}}

